+
+    verbose : bool, default=False
+        If True, progress bar will be shown for downloading or loading files.
+
+    Returns
+    -------
+    data : pd.DataFrame or tuple(list[str], np.ndarray)
+        Depending on the ``as_frame`` argument, one of:
